# Wrangler cache — contains, among other things, our own Cloudflare
# account ID locally in plaintext
.wrangler/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Generated by `npm run test:coverage` (c8) — regenerated on every run,
# nothing to version.
coverage/

# System
.DS_Store

# Personal Apps Script automation (Björn's own mail agent) — not part of
# the published "Heute Schule" web tool. Genuinely contains family-
# specific data (real Mensamax usernames, private email addresses, real
# class/institution identifiers), so it stays out.
stundenplan_agent.gs

# Ad-hoc diagnostic tools, not part of the published app
diagnose-*.html

# Legal documents taken over from third parties (e.g. Cloudflare contract
# text saved locally as a PDF) — local evidence for the processing
# register, not our own text. Not to be pulled into a later public repo
# without asking; Cloudflare's originals stay available at the URLs
# linked in Verarbeitungsverzeichnis-INTERN.md.
Cloudflare-*.pdf

# Real legal text with personal contact details (name, address, phone,
# email). The MIT license covers the code, not automatically the private
# contact details in the content. The real files stay here on disk and
# get deployed normally (§ 5 DDG requires a real Impressum on the LIVE
# website — that's independent of what's in Git). Templates with
# placeholders live in the repo instead: web/impressum.example.html,
# web/datenschutz.example.html.
web/impressum.html
web/datenschutz.html

# Internal processing register, per its own name not meant for third
# parties (see the file's own header). Stays present locally, just not
# version-controlled.
Verarbeitungsverzeichnis-INTERN.md

# Regenerated by deploy.sh on every deploy (current Git HEAD hash) — the
# basis for the live-vs-HEAD check after the website deploy. Not
# standalone content, nothing to version.
web/deploy-commit.txt
